From 1c0035fae2926d206073c5cbb2765f98d6e616c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:37:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: simple: af: Local search, steadier continuous mode,
 focus window

Refocus with a search around the current lens position instead of a scan
of the whole range, wait for a steady scene before searching, check the
result, hold the exposure and gather the focus measure on every frame
while searching, and let the application choose the focus window
(AfMetering, AfWindows). The full scan starts from the near end.
